# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Survey microdata is NEVER committed, including to a private repo. CES carries
# zipcode, county FIPS, birth year, state, and voter-file-matched validation
# fields; zip + birth year + sex is the textbook re-identification triple.
#
# Deny by default on every format the data plausibly arrives in, anywhere in
# the tree — not just under data/raw/. Dataverse hands you `dataverse_files.zip`
# and exports `.tab`, so those are the likely names, not edge cases.
#
# Only data/models/*.json is tracked: fitted coefficients over tens of
# thousands of respondents, from which nothing individual survives.
# scripts/check-no-microdata.mjs enforces this; `npm test` runs it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/raw/
*.dta
*.sav
*.por
*.rds
*.RData
*.rdata
*.tab
*.csv
*.tsv
*.zip
*.gz
*.7z
*.parquet
*.feather

.venv/
__pycache__/
